sla at la 0
av at la 1
t5 at la 2
lb call arena_load t5 b 0 3
slb at lb 0
bv at lb 1
t6 at lb 2
last call arena_load t6 a 69999 1
slast at last 0
lastpage at last 1
lastzero get lastpage 0
t7 at last 2
bad call arena_load t7 a 69999 2
badstatus at bad 0
